  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ tekɛ ko̱r mi cu jääny kam thuɔk duëël Thɔɔl kɛnɛ thok duëël Dee-bid. Kä cu buɔ̱m ni thok duëël Dee-bid kä thok duëël Thɔɔl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gaat Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaat tëë ca da̱p Dee-bid kä Ɣɛb-ron. Gatdɛ min nhiam ɛ Ɛ̈m-non, gat ciekdɛ ni Ä-ɣi-no-am nya Yidh-rɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu rɛwdɛ a Kil-ab gat Ä-bi-ga-yil ciek jɔkä ni Na-bal kä Kar-mɛl. Kä cu diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn a Ɛ̈b-ca-lom gat Maakaa nya Tɛ̈l-may kuäär Gɛ-cur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ŋuaandiɛn a Ä-do-ni-yaa gat Ɣɛ̈-gith. Kä cu dhieecdiɛn a Cɛ-pɛ̈t-yaa gat Ä-bi-tal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bäkɛliɛn a Yith-rɛ-am gat Ɛg-laa ciek Dee-bid. Kɛn ti̱ti̱ cua kɛ da̱p Dee-bid kä Ɣɛb-ron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mat ruac kam Ä-bi-ner kɛnɛ Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë nyiëëny thok duëël Thɔɔl kɛnɛ thok duëël Dee-bid, cu Ä-bi-ner rɔ jak kä bum thok duëël Thɔɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tëë kɛ luɔm Thɔɔl mi cɔali Ridh-paa nya Aya. Kä cu Ic-bo-cɛth Ä-bi-ner jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu ci luɔm gua̱a̱r ka̱n ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-ner gaak kä cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ku Ɣän ɛ jiök kä Juda? Kɛn ni̱ni ti̱ti̱ nyuɔthä ciaŋ mi gɔaa dhɔr guur ni Thɔɔl, gɔaa kamdä kɛ gaatman, kɛnɛ mäthnikɛ kä /ka̱n yɛ ka̱m Dee-bid. Kä ɛn walɛ gɔɔnyi ɣä kɛ kui̱ ciek mi thil luɔt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial, ɣän dëë li̱w mi /ka̱n Dee-bid lät kä mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ ya̱c jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi kuäär jiɛɛn dhɔr Thɔɔl, kä ba jɛ ka̱m Dee-bid ala kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛnɛ Juda, a känɛ ni kä Daan a räth nikä Ber-cɛ-ba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken Ic-bo-cɛth Ä-bi-ner loc kɛ riet, kɛ ɣöö cɛ dual kɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-ner naath jäk kä Dee-bid kɛ ruacdɛ wee i̱, “Ɛ mun ŋa ɛn nɛmɛ? Mat nɛ ruac, kä nɛnɛ, ɣän bä te kɛɛl kɛ ji̱, bä ji̱ nöŋ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wee i̱, “Gɔaaɛ. Banɛ ruac mat. Duundɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ kɛl mi bä thiec kä ji̱ ɛ ɣöö /ci bi ben nhiamdä, ɛ ni mi ci Mi-kal nya Thɔɔl nööŋ kɛ nhiam, mi wi̱i̱ wä ben kä ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid naath jäk kä Ic-bo-cɛth gat Thɔɔl, wee i̱, “Käm ni ɣä ciekdä ni Mi-kal, mëë cä kuɛn kɛ gup ti kuɔ̱r tëë cuɛ̈ɛ̈lä kä ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ic-bo-cɛth jɛ ka̱n kä cɔwdɛ ni Pɛ̈l-ti-el gat Lɛ̈-yic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu cɔwdɛ wä kɛɛl kɛ jɛ jälɛ kɛ wiee kɔɔrɛ mäni cuɔ̱pdiɛn kä Bɛ̈-ɣu-rim. Kä cu Ä-bi-ner ɛ jiök i̱, “Ri̱t rɔ.” Kä cuɛ rɔ ri̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-bi-ner ben kä bööth I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Kɛ pek ëë ci wä /cuarɛ Dee-bid go̱r i̱ derɛ a kuäärun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ kua jɛ nööŋ nhial. Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r Dee-bid i̱, ‘Kɛ Dee-bid ja̱ŋdä bä nɛɛkä ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kän kɛ jɛ kä ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt, kɛnɛ ji̱ tɛ̈riɛn diaal.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac bäkɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min. Kä cuɛ wä kä Ɣɛb-ron wee Dee-bid la̱t min ba la̱t ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛnɛ thok duëël Ben-ya-min kɛɛliw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ä-bi-ner ben kä Ɣɛb-ron kä Dee-bid kɛnɛ nɛy ti jiɛɛn da̱ŋ rɛw, cu Dee-bid kɛ lät kä mi̱eth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-ner Dee-bid jiök i̱, “Ɣän bä wä, bä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal wä mat, kä bäkɛ nöŋ kuäärä ni kuäär, kä ba mat ruac lat kɛ ji̱ kä bikɛ cu ruac ce̱tkɛ min go̱o̱r lɔcdu jɛ.” Kä cu Dee-bid Ä-bi-ner jak kä wä. Kä cuɛ wä nikɛ mal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Näk Yo-ab kɛ Ä-bi-ner",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt cu ji̱ kɔaar Dee-bid cop kɛɛl kɛ Yo-ab pëcä, kä cikɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈c ti ŋuan nööŋ kɛɛl kɛ rɔ̱. Duundɛ ɣöö Ä-bi-ner /cɛ te kɛɛl kɛ Dee-bid kä Ɣɛb-ron, kɛ ɣöö cɛ jɛ jak kä wä nikɛ mal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yo-ab ben kɛnɛ rɛm in tekɛ jɛ, cua la̱r Yo-ab i̱, “Ci Ä-bi-ner gat Ner ben kä kuäär, kä cɛ jɛ jak kä wä, a cɛ wä nikɛ mal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ab ben kä kuäär kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu ci la̱t ɔ? Nɛnɛ, Ä-bi-ner cɛ ben kä ji̱. Kuɛ la ŋu jaki jɛ kä wäɔ, a bɛ wä? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋäci jɛ ɛn ɣöö Ä-bi-ner gat Ner bëë kɛ ɣöö bɛ ji̱ kaŋ, kɛnɛ ɣöö bɛ tin diaal tin lätdi ben ŋa̱c.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Yo-ab ben raar kä Dee-bid, cuɛ naath jäk kä kɔɔr Ä-bi-ner, kä cua jɛ wä luɔ̱ɔ̱c jɔk ni wi̱i̱ puɔ̱ɔ̱l kä Thi-raa. Duundɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi ŋäc Dee-bid ɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Ä-bi-ner luny kä Ɣɛb-ron, cu Yo-ab ɛ naŋ gekä ce̱t ruacɛ kɛ jɛ, ɛn wi̱ni cuɛ jɛ näk, cuɛ li̱w kɛ kui̱ riɛm Ä-tha-el däman Yo-ab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ mëë ci Dee-bid ɛ liŋ, cuɛ wee i̱, “Ɣän kɛ kuäärä thilɛ nɛy duer nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kɛ kui̱ riɛm Ä-bi-ner gat Ner. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A jɛ wä ni wi̱i̱ Yo-ab, kɛnɛ dhɔr gua̱n kɛɛliw. Kä a dhɔr Yo-ab tekɛ juey ni ciaŋ, a tekɛ löny mi jiääk, kä a tekɛ dhɔp, kiɛ ŋɔl, kiɛ ram mi na̱kɛ ko̱o̱r, kiɛ näk buɔthkɛ!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Yo-ab kɛnɛ däman ni Ä-bi-cay Ä-bi-ner näk, kɛ ɣöö cɛ dämandiɛn ni Ä-tha-el näk ko̱o̱r kä Gib-yon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuɔ̱ny Ä-bi-ner",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Yo-ab jiök kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ i̱, “Rɛ̈tdɛ bieynikun kä la̱thɛ bieyni cuali, kä parɛ Ä-bi-ner.” Kä cu kuäär ni Dee-bid gal in kapkɛ raan guɔ̱ɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ Ä-bi-ner kony kä Ɣɛb-ron. Kä cu kuäär wiee paarɛ Ä-bi-ner. Kä cu nɛy diaal wiee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Ä-bi-ner par kɛ rieet ti̱ti̱ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal ben kä Dee-bid ba ben com kɛ ɣöö dërɛ mi̱th a /ken ɣɔw ni cuɔ̱l. Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ rɔ yac i̱, “Ce̱tnikɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial dëë li̱w mi cä duɔ̱ɔ̱r cam a /ken cäŋ ni kony!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal ɛ tit, kä cuɛ lɔcdiɛn nhɔk, kä min ci kuäär ɛ la̱t cu nɛy diaal ɛ nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu nɛy diaal ɛ ŋa̱c ɛn cäŋ ëë ɛn ɣöö /ciɛ ruac kua̱r ɛ nɔ na̱kɛ Ä-bi-ner gat Nerɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ji̱ kɔarɛ jiök i̱, “/Ken yɛn ɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö Ci bo̱o̱th kɛnɛ ram mi di̱i̱t li̱w ɛn ni̱ni ti̱ti̱ kä I-thɛ-rɛl? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn ci puɔ̱nydä kɔ̱a̱cɔ ɛn walɛ, cäŋ ni mi ɣän kuäärɛ. Kɛn gaat wutdä mi cɔali Dhɛ-ru-yaa cikɛ bɛ̈c kä ɣä ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Bi Kuoth Nhial ɛ luɔ̱c riɛkdɛ ce̱tnikɛ duerɛ!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
